{
  "slug": "comment-io-docs",
  "name": "Comment Io Docs",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Shared docs where humans and AI agents align in real-time",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `comment` (Work with Comment Docs — create and edit collaborative markdown documents with comments and suggestions), `listen` (Attach this Claude Code session to a Comment.io handle so it wakes natively when someone @mentions that handle), `setup` (Find the smallest working Comment.io route for this agent, from existing tools or a comm link through optional…)\n- **Hooks** (2): `Stop`, `SessionEnd`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install comment-io-docs@claude-community` from `comment-io/claude-code-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
